                "organization": "EVUM Motors",
                "biography": "As Founder and Managing Director of EVUM Motors, Martin Šoltés is based in Munich, where he started the company in 2017 as a spin-off of the Technical University of Munich. He previously studied aerospace engineering in Stuttgart. From 2013 to 2018, he worked on vehicle concepts and mobility in developing countries at the Technical University of Munich. \nEVUM Motors' goal is to make a simple, modular and robust electric vehicle that can be used on roads around the world and enable everyone to access mobility. We see the electric vehicle as a source of power and energy and we want to enhance their impact on the way the work is done.",
