                "biography": "essica is the co-founder of Olive Gaea, a UAE-based climate-tech startup offering AI-driven carbon management solutions. Recognized as a top female leader in sustainability, she has been honored by BCG, Google for Startups, and Standard Chartered. With 15 years in PR, International Affairs, and Sustainability, Jessica has guided organizations in MENA on strategic communications and sustainability. She holds a B.A. in Political Science, an M.A. in International Affairs (University of Turin), an M.A. in Strategic PR (George Washington University), and certifications in Sustainability from MIT, Harvard Extension School, and Harvard Business School Online.",
