                "biography": "Being at the crossroads of Vietnamese traditions, Canadian openness and Swiss work ethics, Son-Trang offers a broad and international view to BENCH as the Conference Production Manager. Son-Trang was also the very first Vietnamese and youngest professional to moderate a CEO Panel at the Future of Hospitality Summit in Dubai at the age of 23. \n\nHaving a strong background in Hospitality since graduating from EHL, Son-Trang's main goal is to bring forward change in diversity in the industry.",
