                "jobTitle": "Managing Director",
                "lastName": "Ahamed",
                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/f704fc6dead54ffcb162e11434543fc8.jpeg",
                "organization": "Twenty14 Holdings",
                "biography": "Adeeb Ahamed is the Managing Director of Twenty14 Holdings, an Abu Dhabi based holding company with over $650 million invested in luxury hospitality assets around the world. He is a multifaceted entrepreneur spearheading several companies in financial services, F&B and hospitality. Adeeb started his entrepreneurial journey with the founding of LuLu Financial Holdings in 2009. The honors he has been awarded include Forbes Top Travel & Tourism Leaders in the Middle East 2024 and the Forbes World’s Top Heritage Hotels with Owners from the Middle East 2020.",
