                "photoUrl": "https://cdn-api.swapcard.com/public/images/0f23ecf59ba442a396d3bcf6966bbcfe.png",
                "organization": "TUI BLUE Hotels & Resorts",
                "biography": "Artur Gerber joined TUI Group in 2015 as Managing Director TUI BLUE and has developed the new brand to become the fastest-growing hotel brand in the history of TUI. He leads the business and pursues the growth strategy. Artur's responsibilities include Operations, Business Development, and Brand Partnership for TUI BLUE.\n\nArtur has many years of experience in the hotel industry. He began his career in tourism in 1986 with an apprenticeship as a hotel specialist at Dorint Hotels & Resorts and became General Manager within a few years. He is based in Germany.\n\nFurther professional stations were Center Parcs Deutschland GmbH as General Manager and Development Manager. For Aldiana GmbH, he was first responsible as Director of Operations and later as Managing Director. Before joining TUI, he was the CEO of HMS Hotel Management Services GmbH, which operates and develops new international hotels for the Maritim Hotel Group.\n\nOutside of work, Artur likes to go golfing.",
