                "biography": "Mohannad is a Vice President in SEDCO Capital’s Regional Real Estate team, overseeing a SAR 15 billion real estate and hospitality portfolio that includes 21 income generating properties and 12 development funds across Saudi Arabia. \nWith over 10 years of experience, he previously served as a Senior Manager at EY’s Strategy and Transactions practice, focusing on real estate and hospitality projects, and worked as an Acquisition Analyst for a REIT in New York City. Mohannad holds a bachelor’s in hospitality and Tourism Management from Royal Roads University and a master’s in real estate development from Georgetown University.",
