                "biography": "Nouran Farouk is the Cofounder of Dosy\nShe is a trained physician , social enterpreneur and social media & marketing specialist, with an interest in healthcare and lifestyle. She is an active volunteer within the startup environment supporting ventures focused on health, wellbeing, and food.She has has more than 7 years of experience in well-being and nutrition which also helps in convincing our customers of riding healthy means of transport like bicycles and scooters. \nShe has also worked on other projects like Healthyia & many other startups",
