                "biography": "Doaa is a seasoned senior-level leader renowned for her strategic prowess and innovative mindset. With over 19 years of experience spanning diverse industries including manufacturing, retail, financial services, and technology, she has excelled in roles across established businesses and startups alike. Her professional journey includes impactful contributions to renowned organizations such as Delivery Hero (Otlob & talabat) and Lezzoo in Kurdistan, where she played pivotal roles in the food-tech sector.\n\nComplementing her extensive practical expertise, Doaa is committed to academic growth, holding degrees and an MBA from prestigious institutions including The American and German universities in Egypt. Her dedication to lifelong learning underscores her pursuit of personal and professional excellence.\n\nCentral to Doaa's core beliefs is the belief in the transformative power of knowledge sharing and continuous learning. She champions collaboration and ongoing improvement within her teams and organizations, fostering inclusive environments that prioritize mentorship and human-centric leadership. Renowned for her exceptional communication skills, Doaa is adept at building enduring relationships with stakeholders.\n\nBeyond her professional endeavors, Doaa finds purpose and motivation in her role as a mother to two remarkable children: a 17-year-old young gentleman and a 10-year-old princess. Their presence fuels her determination to lead a life marked by success and fulfillment.",
