                "jobTitle": "Founder & Managing Director",
                "lastName": "Cartwright",
                "photoUrl": "https://cdn-api.swapcard.com/public/images/efa02cf95da1468d9d912a2d6314cb69.jpeg",
                "organization": "Black Coral Consulting",
                "biography": "With over two decades of experience in the hospitality industry, Judith has worked with top executives and leading hospitality companies including Boutique Group, Four Seasons, Wynn, CoolInc, Azmont Investments, Grupo Vidanta, and Global Hotel Alliance to name a few.\n\nHer global career in hospitality culminated in her role as Global Senior Vice President of Revenue Management & Distribution at Kerzner. As head of revenue for the Atlantis, One&Only, and Mazagan brands, she led teams to achieve double-digit growth by optimizing operations and identifying new revenue sources. Judith brings this expertise to her current consulting work, helping clients improve their revenue strategies.\n\nSince launching Black Coral Consulting, Judith has received numerous awards for her consultancy work, including becoming a proud Member of ISHC, the leading source of global hospitality expertise, Chair of the Revenue Optimization Advisory Board for HSMAI, and a member of the Hotelier's Guild Academy of Hospitality Arts. Her success has made her a sought-after speaker, and she is frequently invited to participate in panels and conferences. \n\nAdditionally, Judith is the author of the acclaimed book \"Asset Management with a Commercial Lens\" which has been widely praised by industry professionals for its insightful analysis and practical advice.\n\nBased in Dubai and drawing on her extensive regional and global experience, Judith is deeply committed to helping her clients thrive and succeed.",
