                "biography": "Mohamed Abdalla Al Zaabi, the visionary leader and the Group Chief Executive Officer of Miral, has been a driving force in transforming the company into a powerhouse within the leisure, entertainment and tourism sector. Joining Miral in 2015, Al Zaabi’s strategic insight and unwavering dedication have propelled Miral to the forefront of the industry.\n\nUnder his leadership, Yas Island, Abu Dhabi, has thrived into a global renowned entertainment, leisure, and business destination, while accelerating the realization of the Emirate’s economic diversification. \n\nAl Zaabi’s leadership played a key role in shaping Yas Island’s destination strategy that has contributed to the emirate’s consistent growth. By introducing new attractions and experiences, Yas Island has seen a constant growth in visitation. Building on Yas Island’s successful destination management, Miral was appointed to oversee destination management for Saadiyat Island in 2022 and has since then elevated the destination’s awareness. \n\nAs one of the most influential people in his industry, he was recognized in the top ten of Forbes Middle East’s Top 100 Travel & Tourism Leaders for 2024.",
