                "biography": "Amit Nayak is a seasoned Senior Asset Management Specialist with expertise in Property Development, Private Equity, and Family Office operations. Until recently, he served as Vice President of Asset Management at Dubai Holding, overseeing & supporting the strategic management of over 50 global properties. Currently, Amit is a member of the Hospitality Advisory Committee under the UAE Ministry of Economy, contributing to the growth and competitiveness of the UAE's tourism sector. His career began at One & Only Royal Mirage, and he holds advanced qualifications from Harvard and Cornell. Amit is also actively involved in mentoring and industry associations.",
