                "organization": "Salasia Group",
                "biography": "Marta Garcia de Alcaraz is the co-founder of Salasia Group, leading a transformative project to revitalize one of Madrid’s most historic properties, located just 35 minutes from the city. This visionary endeavor will create a world-class wellness retreat, drawing on the globally renowned healing waters of Carabaña, celebrated for their therapeutic powers for over a century. With Dagny Pétursdóttir, former General Manager of Blue Lagoon Iceland, as a key advisor, Salasia is poised to become one of Europe’s top wellness destinations. Investors are invited to seize this high-growth, high-profit opportunity in Madrid’s booming tourism sector.",
