                "biography": "Philipp Klohr leads Mubadala’s hospitality portfolio including its asset management, investment and divestment functions.  Mubadala is an Abu Dhabi based diversified global investment firm with over US$280bn assets under management, and holds investments in international hotel real estate and hospitality operating companies.  Prior to joining Mubadala, Philipp worked for London-based hotel investment firm Cedar Capital Partners where he was involved in the firm’s acquisitions and asset management functions, focusing on hospitality related value-add and turnaround opportunities.  Before that, Philipp worked for the London-based hotel brokerage and investment advisory firm HVS Hodges Ward Elliott.  Philipp graduated from the École Hôtelière de Lausanne in Switzerland.",
