                "lastName": "Zahl Jonassen",
                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/219b03e499b54830b2ddcb62e74fbcc1.jpeg",
                "organization": "Marelius AS",
                "biography": "Ottar Zahl Jonassen is an entrepreneur living at the top of Europe. Fueled by positive energy, passion, and creativity, Ottar is deeply connected to his Arctic heritage. With this strong sense of purpose, he is on a mission to transform the region into a world-class destination in the far north.\n\nOttar invites you on an extraordinary journey to the easternmost tip of Norway. Here, Marelius plans to develop an Arctic village with resorts, holiday homes, and a small marina. This wild, untouched landscape, bathed in the midnight sun and winter's Northern Lights, offers rich wildlife, bird cliffs, and dramatic headlands. Experience rivers full of fish, the Arctic Ocean with exotic king crabs, whales, old fishing villages, and vibrant cultures — a world where nature and traditions collide.\n\nOur region, Varanger, has everything — breathtaking nature, colorful horizons, rich cultural heritage, unique experiences, and warm-hearted communities. \n\nWhat we lack is the necessary capital to fully realize the potential of these hidden gems. This gives innovative investors a rare opportunity to join us on an exciting journey, where the rewards extend beyond financial returns to shaping the future of Arctic tourism.\n\nWhile we’ve seen large investments in places like Iceland, Lofoten, and Tromsø, the industry’s presence in this region is still very modest. This is where the \"real deal\" lies — untouched, undiscovered, and waiting for pioneers like you.",
