                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/c7d9ecf2b59d433fadc4d12a20418066.jpeg",
                "organization": "Hilton",
                "biography": "Amir is responsible for driving growth throughout the MENA region for the company’s suite of industry-leading brands.\n\nWith almost 20 years’ experience, Amir has previously held senior development roles for both owners and operators throughout EMEA, and has acted for private and institutional hotel investors in an advisory capacity.\n\nAmir holds a BSc in Hotel Management from the University of Surrey and an MSc in Global Banking and Finance at the London European Business School.\n\nA UK national of Arabic-English descent, Amir is married and has two daughters. He’s also a keen sportsman with a passion for combat and motor sports, tennis and skiing.",
