                "biography": "Michael Dyke is the Chief Executive Officer of New Murabba Development Company, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Saudi Arabia’s Public Investment Fund.\nNew Murabba has been designed to significantly contribute to Riyadh’s future development and its transformation into a global, modern metropolis.\nMichael brings over 37 years of experience leading large-scale business enterprises and projects across multiple sectors and geographies. \nMichael's breadth of experience encompasses diverse sectors, where he has consistently delivered complex projects that shape infrastructure, energy, construction and real estate landscapes.\nHis previous role was CEO for Major Projects at Balfour Beatty.",
