                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/16c7a7e85656472399326fde022e1935.jpeg",
                "organization": "MarBella Collection",
                "biography": "Errikos Christodoulou is a highly experienced Hotel Operations Manager with over 14 years in the hospitality industry. Educated in Switzerland, he holds a Bachelor of Arts in Hotel Management from BHMS, Lucerne. His expertise in strategic planning, team leadership, and service innovation has significantly enhanced guest experiences across multiple luxury properties. Currently leading operations at MarBella, Corfu, he manages a diverse team of 350 employees and oversees a 362-room hotel with 12 F&B outlets. During his tenure, he has been instrumental in redesigning the hotel's F&B product, launching new dining concepts, and implementing cutting-edge operational systems.",
