                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/83256e8bc5924829b3ceea5eaa24a983.jpeg",
                "organization": "Atelier House Hospitality",
                "biography": "Panchali Mahendra, recognized by Forbes Middle East as one of the “Leaders Behind Luxury Dining in the Middle East,” is the CEO of Atelier House Hospitality. Under her leadership, brands such as 11 Woodfire have achieved prestigious accolades, including a Michelin star and ranking #14 on MENA’s 50 Best list. With over two decades in the industry, Panchali has developed 80+ global restaurant concepts. She was named Restaurateur of the Year by Caterer Middle East in 2023, and is a strong advocate for women’s empowerment, being the first woman in hospitality to receive the UAE Golden Visa.",
