                "biography": "Sissi serves as President of the Berlin Fashion Film Festival, showcasing motion pictures from luxury powerhouses like Bvlgari, Prada, and Hermès since 2012. These legacy brands are now exploring new territory in the hospitality industry by blending fashion, lifestyle, and travel.\n\nSissi's award-winning career highlights range from teaching her proprietary Luxury Brand Management MBA curriculum at the world's top fashion and business schools, to designing experiences, products, and spaces that enhance how we live, learn, work, and play. \n\nShe joined Airbnb at its inception, advised Maison Chaumet (LVMH) on their largest travel-inspired high jewellery collection since 1780, hosted a global virtual retreat with the Marriott group, spearheaded the launch of a critically acclaimed farm-to-table culinary lab, and collaborated with the United Nations World Tourism Organization.\n\nBerlin fashion Film Festival's next edition will take place November 13-15, 2024 under the esteemed patronage of the European Union, the city of Berlin, and in partnership with Design Hotels.",
