                "biography": "Was born in Hyderabad and raised in the vibrant city of Surat, Gujarat. I completed a bachelor's degree from the prestigious Welcome group Graduate School of Hotel Administration (WGSHA) in Manipal and am currently pursuing my master's degree at the Emirates Academy of Hospitality Management (EAHM), where I am expanding my expertise in the hotel industry.\n\nApart from academics, I'm a passionate drummer and hold a brown belt in karate, which showcases my dedication to both music and martial arts. As an optimist with a relentless thirst for knowledge and experience, I aim to make my mark in the hospitality sector. My long-term goal is to leverage the experience acquired to launch my venture in the future, combining the entrepreneurial spirit with my love for the industry.",
