                "biography": "As Director of Sustainable Hospitality at Sustainability Kiosk, my passion thrives at the intersection of hospitality and sustainability. For over six years, I've dedicated myself to empowering hotels on their journeys to net-zero, leveraging my 20+ years of experience in Hospitality and Tourism. \nHolding a Business Degree focussed on Tourism; and as a Sustainability Management graduate of the Institute for Sustainability Leadership at the University of Cambridge along with being certified with the Global Sustainable Tourism Council (GSTC), I bring a balance of theoretical knowledge, and actionable solutions. I've witnessed the transformative power of partnerships firsthand, collaborating with hotels and local partners to achieve sustainability goals.  Crafting impactful sustainability programs, genuine reductions and pave the way for knowledge sharing on a larger scale.",
