        "descriptionTranslations": [
            {
                "value": "<p><strong>Smart Grow Farms</strong></p><p>Smart Grow Farms is a technology-driven, ISO-certified indoor vertical farm in Dubai, founded by agri-tech entrepreneur and former banker Ganthi Palvannasundaram. With a mission to revolutionize food production and distribution, the farm uses soilless agriculture methods and advanced automation to monitor and control the growing environment for salad greens, herbs, and vegetables. This innovative approach enhances productivity, improves crop quality, and reduces the need for harmful pesticides, ensuring that the produce is free from bacteria like E.coli, Salmonella, and Legionella. Ganthi’s passion for gardening, nurtured since childhood, led her to leave a successful 14-year banking career to establish Smart Grow Farms, where fresh, local harvests are now a reality. We are delighted to welcome you to our indoor vertical farm to witness the future of agriculture.</p><p><strong>Museum of the Future</strong></p><p>The Museum of the Future in Dubai is an architectural and engineering marvel. It confidently straddles the past and the future, applying advanced technology to traditional artforms. The museum ‘speaks Arabic’: its facade is a canvas for the poetry of His Highness Sheikh Mohammed Bin Rashid Al Maktoum rendered in the calligraphy of Mattar bin Lahej. The Museum of the Future welcomes people of all ages to see, touch, and shape our shared future. Go on a journey through possible futures and bring hope and knowledge back to the present.</p>",
                "language": "en_US"
            }
        ],
